{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）早上9時13分，沙田鄉事會路有專線小巴與客貨車相撞，初步有7人受傷，包括小巴司機及乘客，多部救護車正在場協助。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者由救護員扶上車。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181542220814356480384572.jpeg/o_Lmoo2hxz0yatR103IbZke1WGrMcg7_BTWL_wU1i_8\"/><figcaption>傷者由救護員扶上車。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事客貨車右邊車身損毀。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181542218515746816467910.jpeg/XiB9YgPl8zITQI_U6n9LzVOfWHzusfceFEVnqRRFZ6k\"/><figcaption>涉事客貨車右邊車身損毀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多部救護車在場協助處理傷者。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181542216204554240731948.jpeg/o17f4z3I8xu8RaMzAPvnIN4AYocb9nygJ9k9tyfZPbc\"/><figcaption>多部救護車在場協助處理傷者。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者將送到威爾斯醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181540918214266880514872.jpeg/uvvInqcrrrga_Ie8SfqmrMQifmnxEysWnzsg6p87IOo\"/><figcaption>傷者將送到威爾斯醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T01:59:18.384299+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}